{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402230/extras/c9b82ff593caedaf6452aa75daae7b64.poster.avif?t=1757558998\" width=624 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402230/extras/c9b82ff593caedaf6452aa75daae7b64.webm?t=1757558998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402230/extras/c9b82ff593caedaf6452aa75daae7b64.mp4?t=1757558998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Dive into the unique world of <strong>Sivers</strong> \u2014 a dynamic RPG-roguelike where every battle and every decision influence your survival! Face waves of monsters, use the building system and powerful spells to hold your ground as long as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of Spells:</strong> Combine magical, physical and passive abilities to adapt to different situations and defeat enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Enemies and Bosses:</strong> Foes become increasingly challenging, requiring smart strategies and unexpected ability combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Building System:</strong> Create and upgrade various structures to strengthen your defenses and expand your tactical options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Progression:</strong> Develop your hero, unlock new abilities and upgrade your buildings to survive longer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets and Discoveries:</strong> Explore the world, gather resources and unlock hidden opportunities to aid you in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjustable Difficulty:</strong> Choose a challenge level that suits your playstyle \u2014 from a relaxed run to a true test of skill.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sivers</strong> continues to evolve, adding new features, enemies and mechanics. Fight, build, survive \u2014 and find your path to victory!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3402230?t=1757558998","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3402230?t=1757558998","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402230/83f510f189b61118159cca89d731777203cfebd9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757558998","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402230/83f510f189b61118159cca89d731777203cfebd9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757558998","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3573810,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402230/extras/c9b82ff593caedaf6452aa75daae7b64.poster.avif?t=1757558998\" width=624 height=100 ><sour